<title>USA: Viasoft CEO adds chairmanship.</title>
<headline>Viasoft CEO adds chairmanship.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viasoft Inc said Friday that Steven Whiteman, chief executive officer and president, will take on the additional post of chairman after the resignation of A. LeRoy Ellison.</p>
<p>Ellison, who has been chairman since 1984, will continue on the board of directors.</p>
<p>Whiteman joined Viasoft in 1990 as vice president of sales and marketing and was appointed president in 1993. In 1994 he was appointed CEO and elected to the board.</p>
